"""Legend text mirrors exported estimands, samples and scenario boundaries."""
MAIN=[
('Workload composition and declared permission to defer','工作构成与声明的延后权限',
 '**a,** Requested GPU-hour shares from all 40,522,321 released execution spans, using uncapped duration. The denominator includes online inference, offline inference, training, development, other and unknown work. These are descriptive source totals, not energy shares or an industry estimate. **b,** Training and offline-inference contributions to each eligibility scenario. At 5–20%, a common fraction of low-priority batch work is permitted to wait. The 40% case assumes nearly all batch work opts in; the 60% case replaces 19.058 percentage points of online work with offline work before granting eligibility. Online jobs are never deferred. Source Data retain class-by-priority totals and full-precision scenario definitions.',
 '**a，**采用未截尾时长统计全部 40,522,321 个公开执行区段的申请 GPU 小时份额。分母包含在线推理、离线推理、训练、开发、其他和未知工作。这是源数据总量的描述，不是能耗份额或行业估计。**b，**每档资格中训练与离线推理的贡献。5%–20% 对低优先级批处理采用共同获准等待比例；40% 假定几乎全部批处理同意参与；60% 先将总工作量的 19.058 个百分点由在线替换为离线，再授予资格。在线作业始终不延后。源数据保留类别与优先级交叉汇总及完整精度的情景定义。'),
('Planning capacity and independently tested single offers','规划容量与独立检验的单次承诺',
 '**a,** PI lower tolerance bounds from 100 confirmation scenarios (95% reliability, at least 95% confidence; horizontal marks) and development-selected controller offers (circles; crosses would denote failure to qualify). The two statistics use different constructions and their relative ordering does not imply an information advantage. **b,** Success fractions at the same request under 0-, 2- and 6-h notice, with one-sided 95% Wilson lower limits and 300 independent seeds per condition. Dashed line, 95% qualification threshold. Blue and green identify four- and eight-hour events; shapes distinguish notice. Complete paired outcomes and Holm-adjusted exact McNemar tests are provided. In all ratio plots, * denotes nearly all-batch opt-in at 40%, and † denotes changed business composition at 60%.',
 '**a，**由 100 个确认情景得到的 PI 容忍下界（可靠性 95%、置信度至少 95%；横标），以及开发选出的控制器承诺（圆点；若未通过资格则为叉号）。两项统计构造不同，其高低不表示信息优势。**b，**固定同一请求、提前 0、2、6 小时通知的成功比例，附单侧 95% Wilson 下界；每个条件含 300 个独立种子。虚线为 95% 资格门槛。蓝、绿分别表示四小时和八小时，形状区分通知。完整配对结果及 Holm 校正的精确 McNemar 检验见源数据。所有比例图中，* 表示 40% 需要几乎全部批处理同意参与，† 表示 60% 改变业务构成。'),
('Repeated-programme confirmation and development selection','重复方案的确认与开发选择',
 '**a,b,** All-four-call success for four-hour calls with eight-hour gaps and eight-hour calls with twelve-hour gaps. Grey bars combine four isolated calls at the same clock times; blue bars carry the queue through all four calls. Both conditions use the original selected single-event offer. Bars show observed success and one-sided 95% Wilson lower limits across 300 paired complete scenario seeds. Paired difference intervals are in Supplementary Table 5. **c,d,** One-sided 95% Wilson lower bounds for all four development candidates, expressed as fractions of the single-event offer, on 100 development seeds. The dashed 95% target was not reached by any candidate. This selection outcome is separate from confirmation of the prespecified original offer; it does not imply zero physical repeated capacity. The two programmes retain their own gaps and do not estimate a general gap-response curve.',
 '**a、b，**四小时调用/八小时间隔及八小时调用/十二小时间隔的四次全成功比例。灰柱将相同时刻的四个单独调用组合，蓝柱将队列贯穿四次调用；两者均采用原已选单次承诺。柱为观察成功比例，附 300 个配对完整情景种子的单侧 95% Wilson 下界；配对差异区间见补充表 5。**c、d，**全部四个开发候选（以单次承诺的比例表示）在 100 个开发种子上的单侧 95% Wilson 下界。没有候选达到虚线标出的 95% 目标。这项选值结果与预设原承诺的确认结果分开，不能据此推断物理重复容量为零。两个方案各自保留其间隔，未估计一般的间隔响应曲线。'),
('PV hosting and utilisation across eligibility scenarios','不同资格下的光伏承载与利用率',
 '**a,** Flexible-minus-rigid all-scenario PV hosting gain at at most 5% curtailment. Each boundary is the minimum of 100 scenario capacities; the plotted difference of minima is not a mean effect and has no sampling-error bar. **b,** Mean paired change in PV utilisation for a fixed 500-kW installation, in percentage points, with pointwise 95% intervals from 10,000 paired bootstrap resamples of 100 scenario seeds. Sampling intervals exclude optimisation uncertainty; small signed BESS differences near the relative MIP-gap scale are not resolved benefits or physical losses. Both panels retain the actual power model at fixed GPU count, zero deadline misses and the common 1,100-kW import limit. BESS has 100-kW power and 200-kWh energy. These are full-information planning outcomes, separate from causal-controller qualification.',
 '**a，**弃光不超过 5% 时，灵活减刚性的全情景光伏承载增量。各边界为 100 个情景容量的最小值；绘制的是两个最小值之差，不是均值效应，不附抽样误差线。**b，**固定 500 kW 光伏装置的平均配对利用率变化，单位为百分点，区间为对 100 个种子作 10,000 次配对自助重采样得到的逐项 95% 区间。抽样区间不包含优化不确定性；接近相对 MIP 间隙尺度的微小储能正负差异不解释为已分辨的收益或物理损失。两面板均固定 GPU 数，保留实际功率模型，要求截止时间损失为零，采用共同的 1,100 kW 进口限制。储能功率 100 kW、容量 200 kWh。这是完整信息下的规划结果，与因果控制器资格检验相区分。'),
('Separate controls for GPU allocation and rigid-load power','GPU 分配与刚性功率的独立对照',
 '**a,b,** Four- and eight-hour PI tolerance lower bounds across flexible GPU allocations or unmeasured rigid-class active-power proxies, retaining 10% eligibility, the same 576-GPU installation and paired jobs. Each bound uses 100 confirmation scenarios. Lines join evaluated control settings. **c,d,** Conditional four-hour slack-participation costs at the unchanged primary offer, using all 300 confirmation ledgers, 50 independent calls per annual draw and 1-MW accounting. Crosses would indicate an offer that did not qualify. Costs are the 95th-percentile annual-net-cost decision threshold, not confidence limits. Fixed-request success and PV controls are in Supplementary Fig. 4. Rigid power proxies are not measurements of online inference.',
 '**a、b，**改变灵活 GPU 分配或未测刚性类别活动功率代理时的四/八小时 PI 容忍下界，保持 10% 资格、相同的 576 GPU 设施及配对作业。每个下界使用 100 个确认情景，线连接实际检验设置。**c、d，**固定主体原承诺下，四小时自然空闲参与的条件成本，采用全部 300 份确认账本、每次年度抽样 50 个独立调用及 1 MW 会计尺度。若承诺不合格则标叉。成本为年度净成本第 95 百分位的决策门槛，不是置信限。固定请求成功率及光伏对照见补充图 4。刚性功率代理不是在线推理测量。'),
('Participation thresholds for single and repeated commitments','单次与重复承诺的参与门槛',
 '**a,b,** Required annual capacity payment per offered accounting kilowatt for four- and eight-hour single events, with 50 independently sampled calls per year. Existing slack, reserved headroom and an assumed US$0.25 per deferred GPU-h displaced-value exposure use the same physical ledger. **c,** Complete four-call programmes at 12 independent series per year: original single-event offers reused repeatedly, and smaller selected repeated offers when available. Filled circles mark passage of the pointwise confirmation criterion; crosses mark failure. None of the repeated offers was selected by the separate development rule. A conditional price does not alter either statistical outcome. **d,** Delay-price sensitivity at 10% eligibility. All panels use 1-MW proportional accounting, a US$25,000 annual site charge applied once, and 2,000 common annual draws. Thresholds make the fifth percentile of annual net value non-negative. Contract-specific failure penalties are unpriced; series independence does not simulate a continuous year.',
 '**a、b，**四小时与八小时单次事件每会计承诺千瓦所需的年度容量补偿，每年独立抽样 50 次。现有空闲、预留容量，以及每推迟 GPU 小时假设 0.25 美元挤占价值的情景使用同一物理账本。**c，**每年 12 个独立序列的完整四调用方案：重复使用原单次承诺，以及有候选时采用较小已选重复承诺。实心圆表示通过逐项确认标准，叉号表示未通过。重复承诺均未通过另行开展的开发选值规则。条件价格不改变这两项统计结果。**d，**10% 资格下的延迟价格敏感性。各面板均采用 1 MW 比例会计尺度、每年仅计一次的 25,000 美元站点费用及 2,000 次共同年度抽样，门槛使年度净值的第 5 百分位不为负。合同特定失败罚金未定价；序列独立不等于连续全年模拟。')]

SUPPLEMENT=[
('Study inputs and evidence flow','研究输入与证据流程',
 '**a,** Source composition and declared permission define a paired job template, hardware allocation and hourly deadline queues in the community PCC model. **b,** Development selects requests before independent confirmation; complete trajectories supply the cost ledger. PV and BESS optimisation is a separate full-information branch. Arrows describe model inputs and analysis dependencies, not estimated causal effects.',
 '**a，**源构成和声明授权共同定义社区 PCC 模型中的配对作业模板、硬件分配与小时级截止队列。**b，**开发先选请求，再独立确认；完整轨迹提供成本账本。光伏与储能优化属于单独的完全信息分支。箭头表示模型输入和分析依赖，不是估计的因果效应。'),
('Four-GPU board-power calibration','四 GPU 板卡功率校准',
 '**a,** All 30 per-board run averages from one- and four-GPU training and offline inference. Filled points are fitting runs 1–2; open points are held-out run 3. Boards in one run are not independent replicates. **b,** Active-power estimates and 95% Student-t intervals from two independent four-GPU run means per class. Held-out overall MAE is 3.80 W/GPU. Node overhead and online-serving power were not measured by this calibration.',
 '**a，**单 GPU 与四 GPU 训练及离线推理的全部 30 个逐板卡运行均值。实心点为拟合运行 1–2，空心点为留出运行 3。同次运行中的板卡不是独立重复。**b，**各类两个独立四 GPU 运行均值所得的活动功率估计及 95% Student-t 区间。整体留出 MAE 为每 GPU 3.80 W。本校准未测量节点开销或在线服务功率。'),
('Complete repeated-call trajectories at 10% eligibility','10% 资格下的完整重复调用轨迹',
 '**a,b,** Excess controlled-minus-baseline queued GPU-hours through four calls and the complete clearance tail. **c,d,** Signed PCC-power change over the same period. The original selected single-event offer is used in both programmes. Curves are means and bands are descriptive 5th–95th scenario percentiles over all 300 confirmation seeds, including failed scenarios; they are not confidence intervals. Shading marks event hours. The raw controlled-queue energy field is baseline-subtracted before it is called excess debt in Source Data.',
 '**a、b，**四次调用及完整清空尾段中，受控减基准的额外积压 GPU 小时。**c、d，**同期有符号的 PCC 功率变化。两个方案均使用原已选单次承诺。曲线为全部 300 个确认种子的均值，带为描述性第 5–95 百分位，保留失败情景；它们不是置信区间。阴影表示事件时段。源数据将原始受控队列能量减去基准后，才称为额外债务。'),
('Fixed-request and PV controls at 10% eligibility','10% 资格下的固定请求及光伏对照',
 '**a,** Four- and eight-hour success at the unchanged primary requests, with one-sided 95% Wilson lower limits from 300 seeds. No control-specific offer is reselected. **b,** Difference between flexible and rigid all-scenario PV hosting capacities, with and without BESS, using 100 paired scenarios and zero deadline misses. Both displays change only GPU allocation or the declared rigid-power proxy around the 10% primary case.',
 '**a，**保持主体请求不变时的四/八小时成功比例，附 300 个种子的单侧 95% Wilson 下界；不为各对照重选承诺。**b，**有/无储能时，灵活与刚性全情景光伏承载容量之差，采用 100 个配对情景并要求截止时间损失为零。两图均围绕主体 10% 配置，只改变 GPU 分配或声明的刚性功率代理。'),
('Cost assumptions at 10% eligibility','10% 资格下的成本假设',
 '**a,** Four-hour slack-participation thresholds across the declared waiting prices and annual site charges. **b,** Reserved-headroom thresholds across assumed economic lives of three to six years, retaining the US$25,000 site charge. Both panels reuse all 300 paired single-event ledgers, 50 independent calls per year and 1-MW accounting. Points are annual decision thresholds, with connecting lines to guide the eye; there is no sampling interval. Reserve life is an assumed accounting input, not measured GPU ageing. Complete displacement- and missed-work-price sensitivities are supplied as Source Data.',
 '**a，**各等待价格和年度站点费用下的四小时自然空闲参与门槛。**b，**假定经济寿命三至六年、保留 25,000 美元站点费时的预留容量门槛。两图均复用全部 300 份配对单次账本、每年 50 个独立调用及 1 MW 会计尺度。点是年度决策门槛，连线仅引导阅读，不附抽样区间。预留寿命为会计假设，不是测得的 GPU 老化。完整挤占和未完成工作价格敏感性见源数据。')]
